    title: "Open Rower: Research You Can Trace Back to Its Sources",
    excerpt: "Introducing the Open Rower AI research and intelligence platform. Every answer is a compression of research \u2014 Open Rower is built so that compression can be reversed, from conclusion to claim to evidence to source.",
    category: "Product Launch",
