      "• **AI Intelligence Layer** — Multiple frontier models available side by side, so every task runs on the model best suited to it.\n• **AI Agent Layer** — Autonomous agents deployed across customer support, sales, marketing, finance, HR, operations, research, legal assistance, coding, data analysis, content creation, and project management — able to communicate and collaborate with each other on complex, multi-step work.\n• **Workflow Engine** — A visual, node-based automation system that turns entire business processes into autonomous pipelines.\n• **Knowledge Engine** — Instantly makes AI fluent in your organization's own documents, contracts, policies, and websites.\n• **Integration Layer** — Deep, native connections across the tools your business already runs on.\n• **Analytics Layer** — Continuous measurement of automation savings, agent performance, and workflow efficiency, so ROI isn't a guess — it's a number on a dashboard.",
